ands into an action feed. Supported capture paths include Claude, LangChain, LangGraph, VS Code, AutoGen Studio, LM Studio, Ollama, and Antigravity."}]]}],["$","div","Reconstruct the session",{"className":"feature","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Reconstruct the session"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Session replay follows a run from its trigger through the recorded actions to the outcome. AQL Search Lab adds queries, sequence searches, saved searches, and alerts across the history."}]]}],["$","div","Look for behavioral changes",{"className":"feature","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Look for behavioral changes"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The product’s Behavioral DNA feature establishes normal patterns and flags deviations such as scope creep or suspicious activity for review."}]]}],["$","div","Take the evidence with you",{"className":"feature","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Take the evidence with you"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Hash-chained events make the audit history tamper-evident. PDF, CSV, and JSON exports support human review and machine verification. Governance checks map recorded evidence to supported frameworks."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"how-it-works","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-marker","children":"How it works"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"From idea to action."}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"workflow","children":[["$","li","Connect the capture path",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"step-number","aria-hidden":"true","children":["0",1]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Connect the capture path"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Start on the Agnys website and follow the setup for the tools you use. Supported automatic integrations can capture activity without changing application code."}]]}]]}],["$","li","Run and review",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"step-number","aria-hidden":"true","children":["0",2]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"chi